    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Dog Sit Home, at 158 rue d'Antibes in Cannes, is a dog and cat grooming salon. It appears under this name in the Mappy directory (Pages Jaunes information) and in the ToilettageCanin.fr directory, which uses the public business registers (activity 96.09Z, other personal services).</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>These directories publish no website, phone number, opening hours or prices for the salon, and no self-service washing is mentioned: it is not an automated dogwash station. The postcode differs between directories (06400 or 06150): the address to remember is 158 rue d'Antibes, Cannes.</p>
      <h2>Check before you go</h2>
      <p>The directories give neither a phone number nor opening hours: find the address on site and ask the salon before you come whether it lets you wash your dog yourself and on what terms.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you are after a quick wash with no appointment, a self-service dogwash station is simpler; here it is a grooming salon.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Rue d'Antibes is one of the main shopping streets in Cannes.</p>
